It seems to me the best way to rob a shop requires that you have a passage
out infornt of the shop with a large loop.  Then with a ring of teleport
control you teleport outside of the shop and have the shop keeper chase you
around the loop.  Now you have to get him on the far side of the loop while
your in the shop. (easiest way teleport) take your time cleaning the place
out, because if the loop is designed just right he won't figure out how to
get back.

